  develop strategies for data architecture that align with organizational
  goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in;text-indent:-0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;UserInputTextChar&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Wingdings;&quot;&gt;§&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;UserInputTextChar&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Drive the integration of data from disparate sources, ensuring data
  quality, consistency, and reliability across various platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in;text-indent:-0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;UserInputTextChar&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Wingdings;&quot;&gt;§&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;UserInputTextChar&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Work with data engineering teams to ensure seamless data ingestion,
