  data quality, data integration, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;UserInputTextChar&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;data
  governance, security, data retention, and compliance for data management in
  the cloud.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in;text-indent:-0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;UserInputTextChar&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Wingdings;&quot;&gt;§&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;UserInputTextChar&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mentor and provide technical guidance to junior data engineers and
  architects on the use of cloud data platforms and engineering practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
