&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Write a compelling job description.

Include general job responsibilities, required job skills, and required soft skills.

Use bulleted lists.

Allow job seekers to quickly read information in bulleted descriptions.

Insert text carefully.

Use a &quot;flat&quot; text editor (such as TextEdit or Wordpad) to copy and paste text; avoid using Microsoft Word (since it contains hidden characters).

Avoid links.

