    certification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;·&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;&quot;&gt;       &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9pt;font-family:&#039;Mark for HCA&#039;, sans-serif;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Technical, creative, and
    efficient extraction of related data and analysis techniques to ensure
    quality for prescribed business uses. Knowledge of different database
    systems and data relationships are critical in this role. Manages and
    performs all aspects of data analysis and validation, and application
    functional testing activities for a given effort. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9pt;font-family:&#039;Mark for HCA&#039;, sans-serif;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
