    concepts quickly and experience working in an agile environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9pt;font-family:&#039;Mark for HCA&#039;, sans-serif;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
