    and automated testing of both native, hybrid and web applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9pt;font-family:&#039;Mark for HCA&#039;, sans-serif;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;·&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;&quot;&gt;       &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9pt;font-family:&#039;Mark for HCA&#039;, sans-serif;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Recognized as a subject matter expert (SME) in testing
